# Review PR

Use this only when the user invokes `@review-pr`, “review PR N”, or pastes a PR URL for a house-standards review.

Follow `.cursor/skills/review-pr/SKILL.md`. Do not invent a second workflow here.

- Read-only until the user selects finding IDs to post.
- Use `gh` to fetch and submit.
- Do not run `dotnet build` or `dotnet test` unless the user asks.
- Do not auto-post every finding. Do not change code unless the user asks.
- This is not Bugbot or Security Review.
